{"_id":"6a2ff9cd2204ffbc59e5a7eb","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"Xq7Ho2kWg5AtZK0G6z02U","description":"# Distribution plots\n\nSeaborn's distribution plots visualize the distribution of one or two variables. `sns.histplot()` and `sns.kdeplot()` show the shape of a single variable's distribution. `sns.displot()` combines both. `sns.pairplot()` shows pairwise distributions and relationships across all numeric columns in a DataFrame.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Visualizing distributions of data","url":"https://seaborn.pydata.org/tutorial/distributions.html","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb71"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T13:10:37.780Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/Xq7Ho2kWg5AtZK0G6z02U.md"}